          </li>
          <li class="join"><a href="https://github.com/owner/app/pull/42" rel="noreferrer noopener"><span class="id"><bdi>owner/app#42</bdi></span></a> <bdi>Tidy the search index job</bdi> <span class="state">merged</span><br><span class="joinbadge">joined by description &rarr; <bdi>tracker:ABC-12</bdi></span>
