          <li class="join"><span class="id"><bdi>owner/app:feature/result-filters</bdi></span> <span class="state">open</span><br><span class="joinbadge">joined by pull_request &rarr; <bdi>tracker:ABC-13</bdi> via <bdi>hub:owner/app#41</bdi></span>
